  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p><!--StartFragment--><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">우리학교는 학기 초에, 단원 순서를 조정하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그래서 현재 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">단원 수업을 하고 있습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">화학단원은 모두 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학기에</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">연속설과 입자설의 개념을 쉽게 이해하는 방법으로 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학습 만화로 표현하기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&gt; </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수업을 생각해 보았습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">교과서 본문 중에 다음과 같은 내용이 포함되어야 한다고 미리 알려주었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그림 자체는 간단히</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">내용이 중요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">필수 포함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp; ① </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">아리스토텔레스</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">데모크리토스의 주장</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp; ② </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">물질의 부피가 줄어드는 까닭 설명하기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">연속설과 입자설의 관점에서</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">주사기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp; ③ </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">보일의 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">J</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">자관 실험</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp; ④ </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">돌턴의 원자설</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">상세 내용 기록</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">×)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp; ⑤ </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">결론</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이후 여러 과학자들에 의해 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">의 존재가 확인<span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99C133495B8F292431\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"연속설과 입자설.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_99C133495B8F29243177A6\"/><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴바탕;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p><br></p></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
